From an unrelated working directory, the actual configured executable
accepted an explicitly selected existing legacy catalogue. Xvfb/X11
OpenGL and dummy-audio smokes passed aspect-fit, integer, stretch and
adaptive with touch; fill passed without touch and was rejected with
touch. All five admitted windowed runs verified 444 camera columns,
600 movement and 20 combat submissions with zero 16.667 ms host-work
budget misses. Adaptive extended the touch scene to 426 by 304.
A fullscreen adaptive run passed functional checks with four movement
budget misses (maximum 21.012 ms). This is not a controlled performance
